'''PAC-MAN''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be purchased from a special sale during the [[PAC-MAN Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 15.5 Update|Version 15.5]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 866
|rarity = EX
|name1 = PAC-MAN
|name2 = Cat PAC-MAN
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Cat PAC-MAN''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
PAC-MAN is a specialist anti-Red/Zombie tank, highly comparable to [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fried Shrimp Cat]]. Prior to the latter's True Form, Pac Man actually has a considerable stat advantage against Reds and doesn't rely on Weaken procs to pick up the slack—especially with his "Resistant" Effects Up [[Cat Combo]]. Zombies, in particular, don't have a reliable tank outside of [[Li'l Sakonji Urokodaki (Super Rare Cat)|Collaboration Gachas]] either, making him exceptionally valuable in that regard. Furthermore, he's available in {{4c}} restriction stages thanks to him being a Special Cat.

As you progress in the game, however, PAC-MAN begins losing considerable steam. Against Reds, Roe Cat basically outperforms him in every metric, while becoming even cheaper with [[Talents]]. [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Shigong Cat]]'s status as a disposable meatshield is actually more advantageous in many situations, since Zombies tend to be quite stringent with cash drops. More often than not, it is unsustainable to spend such capital on a pure tank, whose range is so low it completely exposes the unit to non-target peons like [[Doge Dark]]. He's not useless by any means, but the alternatives are just better-suited to their niches than PAC-MAN.

However, his Cat Combo completely flips things on their head. You can use PAC-MAN with the aforementioned cats to boost their effective HP even more, plus you gain access to a reliable back-up tank that you can deploy alongside Shigong Cat, [[Carpenter Cat (Rare Cat)|Carpenter Cat]], or Roe Cat if the situation calls for it. This can even apply to meatshields/tanks of other traits like [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]], [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]], [[Maize Cat (Rare Cat)|Maize Cat]], [[Jetpack Cat (Rare Cat)|Jetpack Cat]], and what have you. It is a very versatile 1-slot Cat Combo, and singlehandedly makes PAC-MAN worth considering for purchase.

{{Job|Classification = Tanker & Combo Slave}}

